	You are in a narrow part of the canyon.
The two sheer sides are no more than a few meters apart here. There is a stone
door in the wall ahead. The gravelly floor runs with tiny rivulets seeping 
from the ground itself. The canyon continues right and left.

>-: The door does not budge.
